ino could push this into tossup territory.", "confidence": "medium", "notes": ["Open seat: Elise Stefanik (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Elise Stefanik's retirement leaves an open seat in a Republican-leaning North Country district, with businessman Anthony Constantino facing dairy farmer Blake Gendebien. Constantino has heavily outspent the field, though Gendebien holds more cash on hand despite raising less. National attention has grown, with Vice President Vance campaigning for Constantino and headlines describing the race as tightening.\n\nPolling is unusually close for a district this red: recent surveys range from Gendebien up four to Constantino up three, and the average sits near even. Every major rater still calls the race Lean or Likely Republican, and prediction markets give the Democrat roughly a one-in-three chance. The fundamentals favor Constantino, but the margin is narrow enough that a strong Democratic environment could decide it.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1406, "margin": -6.22}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2036, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1958, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2007, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1538, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.1549, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2301, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2417, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.1919, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1959, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.1935, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1967, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2046, "margin": -5.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.1363, "margin": -6.8}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.1525, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.1259, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.1676, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.3186, "